                                "sense_id": "52f37e7e-2269-3125-b3f1-f97ccb356750",
                                "text": "Turning to the post-Beowulf Cynewulfian poems, one notes the same duality between spiritual and natural \"harmers\" in the use of the word."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c52cb924-f05e-4604-9e43-fdb39cda5254",
                                "sense_id": "52f37e7e-2269-3125-b3f1-f97ccb356750",
                                "text": "And if the rich succeed in using the surplus, they would also be the first harmers because the poor are thereby made worse off."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
